The MIT licence above covers the code and documentation of this repository.
Two files are third-party data from the Australian Bureau of Statistics (ABS),
used under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/):

  anzsrc2020_for.xlsx
      Source: Australian Bureau of Statistics, "Australian and New Zealand Standard
      Research Classification (ANZSRC), 2020: Fields of Research (FoR)",
      cat. no. 1297.0, released 24 October 2025.

  data_prep/anzsrc_for2008_to_2020_ABS.csv
      Derived from: Australian Bureau of Statistics, "ANZSRC 2020 - Correspondence
      Tables", Table 2 "ANZSRC 2008 FoR - ANZSRC 2020 FoR", cat. no. 1297.0,
      released 24 October 2025 (columns kept: code_2008, code_2020, partial).
